WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:01.901
CHRIS PRATT
What's up everybody?

00:00:01.952 --> 00:00:02.875
Chris Pratt here.

00:00:03.963 --> 00:00:06.936
They've given me a camera
and a list of rules.  All of which...

00:00:07.477 --> 00:00:08.374
...I'm gonna ignore.

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:12.526
To be reunited with this Guardians
family for Volume 3,

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.579
it's really fantastic.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:17.063
ZOE SALDAÑA
We're genuine fans, so there's something

00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:19.765
really sweet about geeking out on set.

00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.283
[Laughing]

00:00:22.393 --> 00:00:23.393
JAMES GUNN
You had me at...

00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:24.490
POM KLEMENTIEFF
Hello.

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:25.541
[Laughing]

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:28.510
KEVIN FEIGE
The Guardians is about humor.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:31.109
It's about action. It's about
cosmic adventures.

00:00:32.195 --> 00:00:33.377
NEBULA
Drax, sit up.

00:00:33.437 --> 00:00:34.339
DRAX
It's what it's here for!

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:35.315
PETER QUILL
Drax, it's called a sofa.

00:00:35.366 --> 00:00:36.067
It's not a bed.

00:00:36.117 --> 00:00:37.399
DRAX
Well, I find it hard to believe

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.982
it doesn't have multiple purposes.

00:00:40.289 --> 00:00:42.545
KEVIN FEIGE
But it's really about this found family.

00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:45.537
MANTIS
Don't forget where we came from.

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:47.552
KAREN GILLAN
This is a Rocket origin story.

00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:50.063
We are learning more and more
about what Rocket has been through.

00:00:51.096 --> 00:00:52.827
PETER QUILL
We were always searching for a family,

00:00:52.878 --> 00:00:54.458
until we found each other.

00:00:54.509 --> 00:00:55.205
DRAX
Yeah!

00:00:55.671 --> 00:00:56.785
ROCKET
Let's give the galaxy

00:00:56.836 --> 00:00:58.315
something to remember us by.

00:01:00.612 --> 00:01:01.892
POM KLEMENTIEFF
It's so beautiful.

00:01:02.875 --> 00:01:04.465
Everything is in the details.

00:01:04.581 --> 00:01:08.211
CHRIS PRATT
Its imagination, music, beautiful imagery.

00:01:08.262 --> 00:01:11.714
It's really a fantastic story from the
brain of a mad genius, James Gunn.

00:01:12.841 --> 00:01:14.720
JAMES GUNN
Everything that drives it is that

00:01:14.771 --> 00:01:19.672
emotional center of all of these
characters who were all outsiders.

00:01:19.941 --> 00:01:22.275
PETER QUILL
We have been running our whole lives.

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:24.640
ROCKET
Pete, I'm done running.

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:27.414
DAVE BAUTISTA
I love everybody,

00:01:27.465 --> 00:01:29.293
and I'm so proud of what
we've accomplished.

00:01:29.626 --> 00:01:30.685
DRAX
I want you all to know that

00:01:30.737 --> 00:01:33.194
I am grateful to fight
beside my friends.

00:01:34.364 --> 00:01:36.142
CHRIS PRATT
It's another rock opera.

00:01:36.193 --> 00:01:39.384
It's really fantastic and it
wraps it up in a way that

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:41.115
really only James could.

00:01:41.359 --> 00:01:42.359
PETER QUILL
Are you ready...

00:01:43.345 --> 00:01:44.408
...for one last ride?

00:01:45.648 --> 00:01:47.195
ROCKET
We'll all fly away together...

00:01:47.908 --> 00:01:49.090
...into the forever...

00:01:49.141 --> 00:01:50.400
PETER QUILL
[Screams]

00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:51.971
ROCKET
...and beautiful sky.

00:01:52.484 --> 00:01:55.844
♫ Since you been gone ♫

00:01:56.143 --> 00:01:58.139
CHRIS PRATT
Thank God I don't operate the camera

00:01:58.190 --> 00:02:01.412
for this movie, because if
I did, it would look terrible.

